idea of introducing clan-related subplots through Elysium, and I think an Elysium having the feel of a certain clan (although it would seem that the Gangrel Elysium described above may not be a great fit for that <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) would add to the drama of the place, instead of it &quot;merely&quot; being yet another Elysium.<br /> <br /> It should be noted that this is my first time running a VtR chronicle, and my players first time experiencing this world. Although we each have oWoD backgrounds, having played both DtF and VtM. And I suspect that my players would like having an &quot;easy&quot; way to deal with their clans while experiencing and getting to know their covenants, which will take the front seat of the chronicle.<br /> <br /> What I was going for with the Gangrel Elysium was an &quot;unleashing the Beast&quot; like quality while asserting some kind of dominance/Alpha-malle presence among the kindred. And my thought was that this kind of structured physical savagery could do that, while also serving as a political use for the competative beast - should the players find themselves in an hour of deperation and need a favor from an elder whilst not having enough leverage to actually negotiate one (but there having the possibility to win the favor).</div> </div> </div> </div>1. You are in a southern city. So the gathering will play by southern rules.<br /> 2. Blood &amp; Smoke (requiem 2nd) assumes most everyone of the same clan in a given city are of the same vampiric family(see blood ties rules).<br /> I submit that these clan elysiums should have the feel of an extended family get together that is open to outsiders.<br /> And every extended family has their family politics.<br /> <br /> Start with Priscus. He or she will set the tone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}